    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5b481fa59cf63f004fdf9cc2",
      "background": "#f5e9dd",
      "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:6rem;\">\n    <img style=\"max-width: 95%; height: auto; width:420px\" width=\"1920\" height=\"808\" src=\"https://codex-content.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/images/1531453270053-rmhs.png\"/>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    Yes art should be like a <aa to=\"49,56,54,78\">dream</aa>, she said. But<br/>\n    the kind of dream where you are doing chores or, <br/>\n    better, inventing a new way to keep things tidy.<br/>\n    And no idea is inlaid, all <aa to=\"132\">clouds</aa> have pants,<br/>\n    you and I are especially alike. \n</div>",
      "created": "2018-07-13T03:42:29.748Z",
      "fullWidth": false,
      "lovers": [
        "599badb12d4c7455551c4ef7"
      ],
      "page": 113,
      "parent": {
        "__v": 0,
        "_id": "5b39cabd1c76e00054b5f2f8",
        "background": "",
        "content": "<p style=\"max-width:none\">Dear Cato I am still yours, a peak body<br/>\nor <em>Union of International Associations</em><br/>and \nyour distant honest Fruit Tree of <br/>\nprotected tended order and your buffer overrun<br/>\nand will you need me any more? once <br/>\nthe new editions of the <em>word en-Masse</em><br/>\nare in harmony? Dear Cato I am inlaid<br/>\nwith business documents and <aa href=\"88,140,34\">school-books</aa>.\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width:none\">▧▧</p>",
        "created": "2018-07-02T06:48:29.058Z",
